{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — 7-Botanical Synergistic Complex Matrix (P07)
  Tailored specifically for 7-in-1 Botanical Multi-Oil Scalp & Strand Elixir (60ml)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-editorial-section zvhc-botanical-wheel-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-pill-bg, #F8E4EB); color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 9999px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <span>✦ FORMULATION COMPOSITION</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">7 Bioactive Botanicals in Precision Synergy</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
        Every drop combines cold-pressed carrier lipids with pure therapeutic-grade rosemary and peppermint essential oils. Zero silicones, mineral oils, or synthetic fragrance extenders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
      <!-- 1. Batana Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">🌰</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">1. Raw Honduran Batana</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Elaeis Oleifera Kernel Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          Rich in omega-9 oleic acid and carotenoids to restore the strand's natural hydrophobic lipid barrier and seal frayed split ends.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Rosemary Essential Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">🌿</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">2. Rosemary Essential Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Rosmarinus Officinalis Leaf Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          Pure steam-distilled essential oil providing an invigorating botanical aroma while supporting microcirculation during scalp massage rituals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Peppermint Essential Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">🌱</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">3. Peppermint Essential Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Mentha Piperita Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          Delivers an immediate cooling, tingling sensation that clears surface congestion and clarifies follicle openings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Black Castor Seed Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">🌾</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">4. Black Castor Seed Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Ricinus Communis Seed Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          High in dense ricinoleic acid to coat fragile strand shafts, increasing tensile strength and resisting mechanical snapping.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Jojoba Golden Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">✨</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">5. Cold-Pressed Jojoba Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          A biomimetic liquid wax ester that mirrors human sebum chemistry to rebalance dry or oily scalp zones without occlusive buildup.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Moroccan Argan Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">💧</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">6. Moroccan Argan Kernel Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          Packed with natural vitamin E tocopherols to polish the outer cuticle layer, reflecting light for brilliant multidimensional shine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Sweet Almond Oil -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 24px 20px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.4rem;">🌸</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">7. Sweet Almond Oil</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700;">Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
          A featherweight nutrient carrier that ensures fast cuticle penetration and zero heavy, greasy residue on pillows or clothing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
